    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24162" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intĕrānĕus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		inter, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>inward</i>, <i>interior</i>, <i>internal.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vomica,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 96</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intĕrānĕ-um</span></b> ,
			i, n., <i>a gut</i>, <i>intestine</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">procedentis interanei morbus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					32, 9, 33, § 105</span></i>
			.—In plur., <i><span class="en">Col. 9,
			14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 30, 7, 20, § 64</span></i>.</div>
